                        ],
                        "form": "неопровержи́мы"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a2eb07d-80f3-31f1-bf8f-8b2830f237ae",
                        "entry_id": "b2891174-a612-3b1d-a7fc-12eb885fb923",
                        "glosses": [
                            "такой, который трудно или невозможно опровергнуть"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ef08dcb-5d4f-42be-9a1e-709bf01f1383",
                        "source_entry_id": "b2891174-a612-3b1d-a7fc-12eb885fb923",
                        "source_sense_id": "3a2eb07d-80f3-31f1-bf8f-8b2830f237ae",
                        "target_lang_word": "irrefutable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irrefutable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                        "entry_id": "4a026a68-4259-3276-ab93-c2ecb6fb506a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "undeniable; unable to be disproved or refuted"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27e216e1-b041-49c6-8ec8-5daaeb5c4bad",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "[…]clear and irrefutable evidence of the Cause I have undertaken"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22d11d16-3a39-4cc3-8553-bb1ed53b57a1",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "True, there had been nothing, in his lifetime, viler than this man. She knew it, there was no other fact within her consciousness that she felt to be so certain; and yet, because her persecutor found himself safe and irrefutable in death, he frowned upon his victim, and threw back the blame on her!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "661b1623-5db3-475d-81ec-44b1d28f8b89",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "He had formed his mind by Helvetius, whose system he deemed irrefutable, and in whom alone he had faith."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ff410fa-3106-472b-8ec3-cdb1a4b938d5",
                                                "sense_id": "ee35c918-2b59-34e1-96f8-4af9f91a5c08",
                                                "text": "I have listened also to the remarks of counsel, with high interest—and especially will I commend the masterly and irrefutable logic of the distinguished gentleman who represents the plaintiff. But gentlemen, let us beware how we allow mere human testimony, human ingenuity in argument and human ideas of equity, to influence us at a moment so solemn as this."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab5dc3d0-178b-4413-847a-811e70e0054a",
                        "source_entry_id": "b2891174-a612-3b1d-a7fc-12eb885fb923",
                        "source_sense_id": "3a2eb07d-80f3-31f1-bf8f-8b2830f237ae",
                        "target_lang_word": "unanswerable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unanswerable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c363868-d834-3a83-963e-74c084567593",
                                        "entry_id": "69d4ed42-6c9d-3595-9871-c9a37600e180",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not answerable; impossible to answer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e9c2ddd-bcb2-3923-993c-a189575051e0",
                                        "entry_id": "69d4ed42-6c9d-3595-9871-c9a37600e180",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible to dispute or rebut; irrefutable; conclusive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "233f73a1-18b2-45bc-bae1-6492d88aa09e",
                                                "sense_id": "2e9c2ddd-bcb2-3923-993c-a189575051e0",
                                                "text": "If I have not said much about it before, it was, of course, that the Professor's earnest desire was that no possible rumor of the unanswerable argument which we carried should be allowed to leak out until the moment came when his enemies were to be confuted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b8522d0-46b8-4402-9f1a-248d680a9357",
                                                "sense_id": "2e9c2ddd-bcb2-3923-993c-a189575051e0",
                                                "text": "The map is never an unanswerable argument in transportation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unanswerable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3faaa90-1170-3da2-82d7-e5e4d9e792dc",
                                        "entry_id": "392e750b-7f95-31f0-a1b7-52dc3bc392fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that cannot be answered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7c33ce8-146e-48e5-a99c-4ca54edd48b4",
                                                "sense_id": "c3faaa90-1170-3da2-82d7-e5e4d9e792dc",
                                                "text": "These unanswerables are left open to the viewer's own construction by the sculptor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
